flowchart TD
  A[Operator obtains citizen consent] --> B{Consent ticked?}
  B -->|No| Locked[Inputs and actions remain disabled]
  B -->|Yes| Upload[Enter case details; add documents]
  Upload --> Check[Operator clicks Check case]
  Check --> Ingest[Auth + validate + scan + encrypted temporary storage]
  Ingest --> Extract[OCR / Gemini: extract fields and confidence]
  Extract --> Normalize[Normalize facts and preserve provenance]
  Normalize --> Audit[Compare facts and flag mismatches]
  Audit --> Rules[Deterministic sourced rules: match or cannot determine]
  Rules --> Review[Human Review step: badges and evidence]
  Review --> Approve{Operator approves?}
  Approve -->|No| Upload
  Approve -->|Yes| Print[Bengali citizen summary; Print]
  Print -.-> Official[Operator separately submits at official portal]
  Ingest -.-> Retain[Timed deletion of raw scans]
